{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "29fa8648-bbde-8cdc-84d8-76c268854626",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T13:35:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:28:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Sandra. Ah, one moment please, I just come in the door from a walk. Let me catch my breath. [pause] Okay. I am sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:28:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, take your time, hon. It's Monday, nobody's going anywhere. You okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:28:56-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I am okay. It is just the stairs, and I walk fast when I am nervous. I am calling because I saw a fox. A fox, in the middle of the day. It is one-thirty almost, with the sun out, and he is just walking on the sidewalk like he pays taxes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:29:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, he might, you never know. A fox out in daylight, huh. Where was this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By my house. I am at 91 Malbone Road, in the North End. He was right in front, near the neighbor's hedge, and then he go into the side yard, behind the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 91 Malbone Road. Did he look sick at all? Stumbling, or acting strange, not scared of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:29:58-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, this is what worries me. He did not run. I stop, maybe ten steps away, and he look at me, and then he just walk slow. Not fast like a wild animal. His fur, it look a little rough, not so nice. I do not know if this is normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:30:24-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'm glad you didn't try to get close to him. Foxes do come through neighborhoods, but one that's out in broad daylight and not bothered by people is worth reporting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is what I think. So I want to ask, who comes for this? Who responds? Is it the police, or is there somebody for the animals?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:30:54-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We've got animal control. They're the ones who'd go out and take a look. I can take down the details and send it over to them, and if it's an emergency, like an animal that's attacking someone, then you'd call the police right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no attack. Nobody is hurt. Only I have neighbors with small dogs, and a lady across the street who have a cat that stay outside. I am thinking about them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's thoughtful of you. Okay, let me get this down. Your name is Rafael?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Rafael Ortiz. O-R-T-I-Z."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:31:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0171. This is the house phone, the landline, so if I am not home it will ring and ring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:32:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, they'll try it. And what time did you see him, about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe twenty minutes ago. I was coming back from my walk, so one-ten, one-fifteen. He went in the side yard of my house, I think, and I did not wait to see where he go after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So your side yard at 91 Malbone, around one-fifteen. Do you have any pets of your own I should note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No pets. Only me inside. But I worry when I go out to the trash, you know? If he is still there. Should I stay inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:32:51-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd stay inside for now, and keep the door closed. Don't leave food out, don't try to shoo him or feed him. If he's still hanging around when the officer gets there, they'll handle it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I do not leave anything outside. Only the trash bin, but it has the lid. It is good, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:33:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A lid helps a lot. Make sure it's closed tight and you're all set there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how long, you think? Today, or maybe tomorrow? I do not want to bother, but I am a little nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:33:40-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're not bothering anybody, that's what we're here for. I can't tell you the exact hour, it depends on what they've got going on this afternoon. But I'll send it over right now marked as a daylight sighting, so they know it's a priority to check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:34:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That is very kind. And if I see him again, I call you again, or I call the animal people directly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:34:15-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one works. If you see him again before they call you, ring us back and I'll add it to your report. And if he ever seems aggressive or stumbles around, or comes at you or a neighbor, that's a 911 call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. 911 if he is aggressive. I understand. [pause] Sorry, my breath is better now, but my heart is still going a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:34:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sit down, have a glass of water. You did the right thing calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:34:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will sit. Thank you, Sandra. You have been very patient with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:35:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime, Rafael. Somebody will be in touch. You take care now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Have a good afternoon. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
